OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister demands 'new deal'
OL,4,Afor Wales, before Plaid Cymru
OL,5,Aconference
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,8,Fwritten to the prime minister to
OL,9,Frequest "a new deal for Wales" before
OL,10,Fhis first Plaid Cymru conference speech
OL,11,Fsince taking office.
OL,13,FIn his letter to Andy Burnham, sent on
OL,14,FThursday and seen by BBC Wales, the
OL,15,FPlaid leader called for more powers to
OL,16,Fbe transferred to Cardiff.
OL,18,FBurnham previously said he would "give
OL,19,Fa fair hearing" to anything put to him
OL,20,Fby the Welsh first minister.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
